  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VeEQ2N0\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_56694573-3efa-443a-8633-442df914dc86.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_a3275c3a-969a-4088-a2c5-53d65a37be07.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_54901d94-6ad2-4408-869f-27ba9026b292.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_b33feea2-9c55-4bae-9b5d-fff3e2ac52db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky/raw/refs/heads/main/presskit.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_c784751f-c531-4487-994e-5049e59f02d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>歡迎來到&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 10: 直上雲霄</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ATM10 與經典空島挑戰的終極融合！在虛空中從一棵樹、一個方塊開始，運用指尖的廣大模組宇宙，開創屬於你的世界。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>性能提示：</strong>請至少分配 <strong>6–8 GB 記憶體</strong> 以獲得最佳體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>多人模式支援：</strong>完整支援伺服器與區域網路遊玩。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任務可選擇：</strong>可跟隨指引前進，或自由開創自己的道路。<br><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LCvCpUhfL2A?si=3FpBxJL1qXK9pgST\" width=\"360\" height=\"216\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hh7aLmgwyMc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"217\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TzgaPq6XY6k\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YvkYIdQNoJU\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>All the Mods 10</strong> 以其精心整合的眾多頂級模組聞名，如今更以空島形式全新登場！從零開始，運用現代自動化、魔法、科技與探索，在虛空邊緣打造你的空中帝國。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_f0f52e24-87e6-4993-bd25-9abce9997875.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"175\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特別感謝 Howester84 為此模組包打造了最受歡迎的兩座島嶼！他還在他的 Discord 上分享了更多設計圖與精彩內容，歡迎<a href=\"https://discord.gg/r6V28h8grJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往支持</a></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>此版本將 ATM10 的高效能世界轉變為以進度為核心的空島挑戰，要求你發揮創意思考與高效自動化，才能抵達終局內容。<br><br>本次最大的變化是我們採用了 <strong>NeoForge</strong>，並使用 <strong>1.21</strong> 版本。隨著模組持續更新，未來還會有更多內容！</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 <strong>All the Mods 10 直上雲霄</strong>，我們將延續傳統，加入眾多新模組，同時追求更高的穩定性。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「All the Mods」真的包含所有模組嗎？不，當然不是。</strong></span></p>",
